  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"IXUlk\" id=\"IXUlk\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u920c97cc\" id=\"u920c97cc\">概述</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u36e12595\" id=\"u36e12595\"><span data-lake-id=\"u98c22f76\" id=\"u98c22f76\">电压检测是测量电路中电压的一种重要方法，它在许多电气和电子应用中都有广泛的用途。以下是需要电压检测的一些主要原因：</span></p><ol list=\"ub1f7a4e5\"><li fid=\"u52d6bd9b\" data-lake-id=\"u3d226902\" id=\"u3d226902\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua7c00e67\" id=\"ua7c00e67\">确保设备安全：电压检测可以确保电气设备在其额定电压范围内运行。如果设备在过高或过低的电压下运行，可能会导致设备损坏、故障甚至火灾。</span></li><li fid=\"u52d6bd9b\" data-lake-id=\"u78efca2c\" id=\"u78efca2c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u930d7927\" id=\"u930d7927\">保护电子设备：电子设备通常对电压波动非常敏感，电压检测可以及时发现问题，保护设备免受损害。</span></li><li fid=\"u52d6bd9b\" data-lake-id=\"ub7dd3eb8\" id=\"ub7dd3eb8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u982d2d56\" id=\"u982d2d56\">提高能源效率：通过电压检测，我们可以监测电气系统的负载、功率和效率，从而优化能源使用，降低能耗。</span></li><li fid=\"u52d6bd9b\" data-lake-id=\"u99420662\" id=\"u99420662\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8f5ebde4\" id=\"u8f5ebde4\">故障诊断：电压检测有助于发现电气系统中的故障和异常，便于维修人员迅速定位问题并进行维修。</span></li><li fid=\"u52d6bd9b\" data-lake-id=\"u8fa064c9\" id=\"u8fa064c9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u06fdc306\" id=\"u06fdc306\">确保系统稳定性：对于某些电气设备，如发电厂、变电站等，电压检测是确保供电系统稳定运行的关键。</span></li><li fid=\"u52d6bd9b\" data-lake-id=\"ub5038328\" id=\"ub5038328\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8836b76d\" id=\"u8836b76d\">设计和研发：在电子产品的设计和研发阶段，电压检测有助于工程师评估电路性能，优化设计。</span></li><li fid=\"u52d6bd9b\" data-lake-id=\"u71281414\" id=\"u71281414\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3794bef6\" id=\"u3794bef6\">满足法规要求：某些行业和地区可能有严格的电压标准和规定，电压检测有助于确保设备符合这些要求。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u4f498563\" id=\"u4f498563\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucf30c990\" id=\"ucf30c990\">总之，电压检测在保障设备安全、提高能效、确保系统稳定性以及满足法规要求等方面都具有重要意义。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub405f2e9\" id=\"ub405f2e9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u57a51447\" id=\"u57a51447\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4e6ac0bb\" id=\"u4e6ac0bb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6b5ffeb9\" id=\"u6b5ffeb9\">在我们当前案例中, 18650锂电池是我们重要设备, 而且它很贵重,一旦过充或者过放, 它将无法使用, 所以我们需要监测锂电池的电压. </span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u691d909d\" id=\"u691d909d\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc460a85c\" id=\"uc460a85c\">18650锂离子电池的过充过放电压值因生产厂家和化学组成有所不同，但通常有一个大致的范围。通常，过充电压值在 4.2V 到 4.25V 之间，过放电压值在 2.5V 到 3.0V 之间。过充和过放电可能会导致电池性能下降、循环寿命缩短甚至安全隐患。所以我们可以设定当</span><span data-lake-id=\"ucbb4393e\" id=\"ucbb4393e\" style=\"background-color: #DF2A3F\">18650的电压低于3.5V</span><span data-lake-id=\"u2d3b166d\" id=\"u2d3b166d\">的时候, 设备断电报警, 让用户及时去充电</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uca7fdde6\" id=\"uca7fdde6\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u99af7ba1\" id=\"u99af7ba1\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1694187561051-592269a0-b204-4d9e-a191-4682cba17a57.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uaf22dc0e-745a-4bc5-a692-c38ca0ddb63%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u5ea98168-f55d-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A371.8181737592399%2C%22height%22%3A387%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A36956%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A409%2C%22originHeight%22%3A426%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.100000023841858%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22ADC%E7%94%B5%E5%8E%8B%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A50%2C%22y%22%3A46%2C%22width%22%3A317%2C%22height%22%3A51%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A8%2C%22y%22%3A54%2C%22width%22%3A12%2C%22height%22%3A339%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2F75777%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A18%2C%22y%22%3A3%2C%22width%22%3A263%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ADCBA%22%2C%22x%22%3A240%2C%22y%22%3A281%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2210K%22%2C%22x%22%3A241%2C%22y%22%3A258%2C%22width%22%3A23%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R34%22%2C%22x%22%3A76%2C%22y%22%3A232%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%A3%22%2C%22x%22%3A43%2C%22y%22%3A178%2C%22width%22%3A21%2C%22height%22%3A41%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VCC%22%2C%22x%22%3A38%2C%22y%22%3A127%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2210K%22%2C%22x%22%3A63%2C%22y%22%3A197%2C%22width%22%3A24%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2210K%22%2C%22x%22%3A79%2C%22y%22%3A259%2C%22width%22%3A23%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Z%22%2C%22x%22%3A304%2C%22y%22%3A239%2C%22width%22%3A18%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R33%22%2C%22x%22%3A239%2C%22y%22%3A232%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R35%22%2C%22x%22%3A63%2C%22y%22%3A183%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2210K%22%2C%22x%22%3A150%2C%22y%22%3A258%2C%22width%22%3A22%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R32%22%2C%22x%22%3A148%2C%22y%22%3A232%2C%22width%22%3A24%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A375%2C%22y%22%3A44%2C%22width%22%3A17%2C%22height%22%3A61%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A379%2C%22y%22%3A228%2C%22width%22%3A13%2C%22height%22%3A171%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3Anull%2C%22y%22%3A0%2C%22width%22%3Anull%2C%22height%22%3A420%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f2f2f1%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u6e693a6f%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc5dd5680\" id=\"uc5dd5680\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1694330842820-6ad19702-c8ae-40b4-aff3-2941d86f9cf8.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u13ed26a9-b6a6-42fb-82b7-4e23d651895%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ued302266-bb81-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A472.7272624811853%2C%22height%22%3A39%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A10540%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A520%2C%22originHeight%22%3A43%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.100000023841858%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22ADCBAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A366%2C%22y%22%3A2%2C%22width%22%3A82%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DCO1INS%22%2C%22x%22%3A212%2C%22y%22%3A4%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22B00T1%22%2C%22x%22%3A33%2C%22y%22%3A14%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DO5%22%2C%22x%22%3A111%2C%22y%22%3A32%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PB1%22%2C%22x%22%3A110%2C%22y%22%3A14%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DDN%22%2C%22x%22%3A34%2C%22y%22%3A33%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2218%22%2C%22x%22%3A167%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22D%22%2C%22x%22%3A110%2C%22y%22%3A0%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2216%22%2C%22x%22%3A168%2C%22y%22%3A2%2C%22width%22%3A19%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f0e5e3%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ue6d83491%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u31eb765a\" id=\"u31eb765a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u51187ec3\" id=\"u51187ec3\">电池电压的变化是模拟信号, 我们需要使用ADC去读取, 在这里我选择使用的是PC5,下面我们就按照常用步骤来开发:</span></p><ol list=\"u2a20adae\"><li fid=\"ua9a2f423\" data-lake-id=\"u47218df1\" id=\"u47218df1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7509fb4b\" id=\"u7509fb4b\">gpio配置</span></li><li fid=\"ua9a2f423\" data-lake-id=\"u6d17a29f\" id=\"u6d17a29f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0555a4d5\" id=\"u0555a4d5\">adc配置</span></li><li fid=\"ua9a2f423\" data-lake-id=\"u10e46439\" id=\"u10e46439\"><span data-lake-id=\"uee27e7bc\" id=\"uee27e7bc\">adc读取</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u714fd552\" id=\"u714fd552\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8bf074fe\" id=\"u8bf074fe\">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"WQ9RI\" id=\"WQ9RI\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf84661b4\" id=\"uf84661b4\">ADC的两种模式</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u59293803\" id=\"u59293803\"><span data-lake-id=\"u915dcbdf\" id=\"u915dcbdf\">在模数转换器（ADC, Analog-to-Digital Converter）中，插入模式和普通模式是指两种不同的数据采集和转换方式。它们之间的主要区别在于采样顺序、通道切换方式和优先级。</span></p><ol list=\"uf1c78118\"><li fid=\"u61cdf678\" data-lake-id=\"u37ee5add\" id=\"u37ee5add\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1b665586\" id=\"u1b665586\">插入模式（Injected Mode）： 插入模式是一种特殊的数据采集方式，它允许在规律的连续采样过程中临时插入对其他通道的采样。插入模式具有较高的优先级，当有插入请求时，会暂停正在进行的普通模式采样，优先处理插入模式的采样任务。插入模式的采样完成后，普通模式采样会继续进行。插入模式通常用于需要快速响应的应用场景，例如突发事件的监测。</span></li><li fid=\"u61cdf678\" data-lake-id=\"u1dcfd8dc\" id=\"u1dcfd8dc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7890ac9c\" id=\"u7890ac9c\">普通模式（Regular Mode）： 普通模式是ADC的一种常规数据采集方式，通常按照预设的通道顺序进行连续或单次采样。在普通模式下，ADC按照设置的采样顺序和频率对各个通道进行采样，将模拟信号转换为数字信号。普通模式适用于大多数数据采集任务，尤其是对实时性要求不高的场景。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u187d8a3f\" id=\"u187d8a3f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u14a9f44c\" id=\"u14a9f44c\">总之，插入模式和普通模式是针对不同应用场景的ADC采样方式。插入模式适用于需要快速响应和高优先级处理的场景，而普通模式适用于常规的连续或单次采样任务。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uba5c51af\" id=\"uba5c51af\"><span data-lake-id=\"u77aa9818\" id=\"u77aa9818\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u42cdc050\" id=\"u42cdc050\"><span data-lake-id=\"u93ffeb86\" id=\"u93ffeb86\">在电压的采样过程中, 我们可以选择插入模式, 也可以选择普通模式.</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"Vhpvp\" id=\"Vhpvp\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0d008221\" id=\"u0d008221\">示例代码</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u3d499a2c\" id=\"u3d499a2c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u97a99352\" id=\"u97a99352\">实现步骤:</span></p><ol list=\"u06a91e97\"><li fid=\"ua7659df8\" data-lake-id=\"ub5c21dd5\" id=\"ub5c21dd5\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf586414d\" id=\"uf586414d\">思考用哪个GPIO,确定引脚PB1</span></li><li fid=\"ua7659df8\" data-lake-id=\"uba919d7d\" id=\"uba919d7d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6ab700e9\" id=\"u6ab700e9\">要开启什么样的功能,是ADC,TIMER,DMA中的哪一个? 确定ADC0_9</span></li><li fid=\"ua7659df8\" data-lake-id=\"ud5bdc918\" id=\"ud5bdc918\"><span data-lake-id=\"u56f52ec9\" id=\"u56f52ec9\">选择使用ADC的普通模式,还是插入模式</span></li><li fid=\"ua7659df8\" data-lake-id=\"u734a3cbc\" id=\"u734a3cbc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u96cea9e4\" id=\"u96cea9e4\">选好之后:</span></li></ol><ol list=\"u06a91e97\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ua7659df8\" data-lake-id=\"ueb678945\" id=\"ueb678945\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3c90deac\" id=\"u3c90deac\">如何初始化</span></li><li fid=\"ua7659df8\" data-lake-id=\"u5f349aef\" id=\"u5f349aef\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1eb209b2\" id=\"u1eb209b2\">如何获取数据</span></li></ol><ol list=\"u06a91e97\" start=\"5\"><li fid=\"ua7659df8\" data-lake-id=\"u411d808c\" id=\"u411d808c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5a56f0c8\" id=\"u5a56f0c8\">数据拿到之后该如何进行换算</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"ub06b43a5\" id=\"ub06b43a5\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub17b5947\" id=\"ub17b5947\">这里面的代码有些复杂, 但是很多代码都是固定写法, 我们可以从gd32官方给的例子里面直接拷贝.</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%5C%22bsp_battery.h%5C%22%5Cn%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cn%23define%20RCU_BATTERY%20RCU_GPIOB%5Cn%23define%20PORT_BATTERY%20GPIOB%5Cn%23define%20PIN_BATTERY%20GPIO_PIN_1%5Cn%5Cn%23define%20ADC_RCU_BATTERY%20RCU_ADC0%5Cn%23define%20ADC_BATTERY%20ADC0%5Cn%23define%20ADC_CHANNEL_BATTERY%20ADC_CHANNEL_9%5Cn%5Cn%5Cnvoid%20bsp_battery_gpio_init()%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%BC%80%E5%90%AF%E6%97%B6%E9%92%9F%5Cn%20%20%20%20rcu_periph_clock_enable(RCU_BATTERY)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AEgpio%5Cn%20%20%20%20gpio_mode_set(PORT_BATTERY%2C%20GPIO_MODE_ANALOG%2CGPIO_PUPD_NONE%2CPIN_BATTERY)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnvoid%20bsp_battery_adc_init()%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%BC%80%E5%90%AF%E6%97%B6%E9%92%9F%E7%BA%BF%5Cn%20%20%20%20rcu_periph_clock_enable(ADC_RCU_BATTERY)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%97%B6%E9%92%9F%E5%80%8D%E9%A2%91%5Cn%20%20%20%20adc_clock_config(ADC_ADCCK_PCLK2_DIV4)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E9%80%9A%E9%81%93%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%5Cn%20%20%20%20adc_channel_length_config(ADC_BATTERY%2CADC_INSERTED_CHANNEL%2C1)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E9%87%87%E9%9B%86%E5%93%AA%E4%B8%AA%E9%80%9A%E9%81%93%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%200%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E8%A7%92%E6%A0%87%5Cn%20%20%20%20adc_inserted_channel_config(ADC_BATTERY%2C0%2CADC_CHANNEL_9%2CADC_SAMPLETIME_480)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20adc_external_trigger_config(ADC_BATTERY%2CADC_INSERTED_CHANNEL%2CDISABLE)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20adc_data_alignment_config(ADC_BATTERY%2CADC_DATAALIGN_RIGHT)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20adc_special_function_config(ADC0%2CADC_SCAN_MODE%2CENABLE)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20adc_enable(ADC_BATTERY)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20adc_calibration_enable(ADC_BATTERY)%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnvoid%20bsp_battery_init(void)%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20bsp_battery_gpio_init()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20bsp_battery_adc_init()%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnfloat%20bsp_battery_get()%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20adc_software_trigger_enable(ADC_BATTERY%2CADC_INSERTED_CHANNEL)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20uint32_t%20data%20%3D%20ADC_IDATA0(ADC_BATTERY)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20float%20vol%20%3D%20data*1.0%2F4096%20*%203.3%20*%204%3B%5Cn%5Ctreturn%20vol%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnvoid%20bsp_battery_test()%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20bsp_battery_init()%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20while(1)%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20float%20bat%20%3D%20bsp_battery_get()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22battery%3A%25f%5C%5Cr%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cbat)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20delay_1ms(500)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2